{"id":506,"date":"2022-04-07T15:03:26","date_gmt":"2022-04-07T15:03:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/pottersbargarage.co.uk\/?p=506"},"modified":"2022-04-11T11:04:45","modified_gmt":"2022-04-11T11:04:45","slug":"signs-that-exhaust-system-needs-repair","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/pottersbargarage.co.uk\/servicing-repairs\/signs-that-exhaust-system-needs-repair\/","title":{"rendered":"Signs that Exhaust System Needs Repair"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Every component of your car has a purpose, and if anyone fails to function, it will affect the car\u2019s efficiency. Hence, a healthy exhaust system is crucial to your car\u2019s safety. Therefore, take good care of your exhaust system, look out for signs when the exhaust system will need repair and service, and take it to the experts for inspection.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Why is the exhaust system important?<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">The exhaust system plays the role of detoxifier and purifier by controlling your vehicle\u2019s emissions. Have you ever heard of the combustion process? Well, that is what happens in the engine to propel the vehicle forward; consequently, this process produces a number of by-products in the form of noxious gasses. Then, the exhaust system plays its role by converting harmful gasses into water vapors and carbon dioxide. Secondly, combustion produces a high temperature that is recirculated back into the chamber \u2013 all thanks to the exhaust system. Moreover, combustion is a noisy process but the exhaust system never fails to reduce the noise.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Signs that the exhaust system needs repair:<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">\u2981\u00a0<\/span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Loud rattling sounds:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Strange and abnormal sounds can be due to a failing catalytic converter, muffler or exhaust pipe. Get your exhaust system inspected immediately if you hear such sounds.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">\u2981\u00a0<\/span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Vibrations:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">If your car is vibrating and losing power, it is an indication that you need to get your exhaust checked. However, vibrations can result from some other causes too. So, take the expert advice.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">\u2981\u00a0<\/span><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Decreased fuel efficiency:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">A leak in a car\u2019s exhaust will affect the pressure in the exhaust system, leading to higher pressure and lower fuel economy and mileage.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Technicians at Potters bar garage specialize in car servicing and repairs. We have a stock of high-quality parts for all of our repairs. So, if your exhaust system is not working properly, then feel free to book your replacement service! Moreover, we offer same-day service for all private and light vehicles.<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Give us a call or drop by our\u00a0<\/span><\/em><\/strong><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/dir\/12+Barnet+Rd,+Potters+Bar+EN6+2QS,+UK\/@51.69163,-0.178666,16z\/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x487622af991cbc97:0xd9596fffa8822911!2m2!1d-0.1786657!2d51.6916295?hl=en-US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><em><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">garage<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/a><strong><em><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">\u00a0for unparalleled service, in case of any problem. At Potters bar, all mechanic work is under-taken at your convenience!<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"r